  "courseId": "voa-pets-responsibility-b1",
  "provider": "VOA Learning English",
  "attribution": "Source: VOA Learning English",
  "licenseNote": "VOA-produced Learning English content is public domain; third-party agency material is excluded.",
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "voa-pets-b1-001",
      "text": "I would have gone, but I was busy.",
      "translation": "我本来会去的，但当时很忙。",
      "start": 8.38,
      "end": 10.98,
      "duration": 2.6,
      "learnable": true,
      "audio": "audio/voa-pets-b1-001.m4a"
    },
    {
      "id": "voa-pets-b1-002",
      "text": "I won first place in a pet contest!",
      "translation": "我在宠物比赛中得了第一名！",
      "start": 14.68,
      "end": 19.18,
      "duration": 4.5,
      "learnable": true,
      "audio": "audio/voa-pets-b1-002.m4a"
    },
    {
      "id": "voa-pets-b1-003",
      "text": "You haven't met my dog, have you?",
      "translation": "你还没见过我的狗，对吧？",
      "start": 51.3,
      "end": 53.34,
      "duration": 2.04,
      "learnable": true,
      "audio": "audio/voa-pets-b1-003.m4a"
    },
    {
      "id": "voa-pets-b1-004",
      "text": "There must have been a dozen different contests.",
      "translation": "一定有十几种不同的比赛。",
      "start": 68.2,
      "end": 72.34,
      "duration": 4.14,
      "learnable": true,
      "audio": "audio/voa-pets-b1-004.m4a"
    },
    {
      "id": "voa-pets-b1-005",
      "text": "Some were pretty strange.",
      "translation": "有些还挺奇怪的。",
      "start": 73.04,
      "end": 75.32,
      "duration": 2.28,
      "learnable": true,
      "audio": "audio/voa-pets-b1-005.m4a"
    },
    {
      "id": "voa-pets-b1-006",
      "text": "How did you win a pet contest without a pet?",
      "translation": "你没有宠物，怎么会赢得宠物比赛呢？",
      "start": 102.7,
      "end": 107.46,
      "duration": 4.76,
      "learnable": true,
      "audio": "audio/voa-pets-b1-006.m4a"
    },
    {
      "id": "voa-pets-b1-007",
      "text": "The closest thing I have is my pet rock.",
      "translation": "我最接近宠物的东西就是我的宠物石头。",
      "start": 108.52,
      "end": 113.84,
      "duration": 5.32,
      "learnable": true,
      "audio": "audio/voa-pets-b1-007.m4a"
    },
    {
      "id": "voa-pets-b1-008",
      "text": "I've had it since I was a little girl.",
      "translation": "我从小女孩时就拥有它了。",
      "start": 117.86,
      "end": 120.48,
      "duration": 2.62,
      "learnable": true,
      "audio": "audio/voa-pets-b1-008.m4a"
    },
    {
      "id": "voa-pets-b1-009",
      "text": "I was invited to enter the one-of-a-kind pet contest.",
      "translation": "我获邀参加这场独一无二的宠物比赛。",
      "start": 124.52,
      "end": 129.5,
      "duration": 4.98,
      "learnable": true,
      "audio": "audio/voa-pets-b1-009.m4a"
    },
    {
      "id": "voa-pets-b1-010",
      "text": "Only you could have won a pet contest with a pet rock.",
      "translation": "只有你能带着一块宠物石头赢得宠物比赛。",
      "start": 132.56,
      "end": 137.6,
      "duration": 5.04,
      "learnable": true,
      "audio": "audio/voa-pets-b1-010.m4a"
    },
    {
      "id": "voa-pets-b1-011",
      "text": "Yes, and they become part of your family.",
      "translation": "是的，它们会成为你家庭的一部分。",
      "start": 194.5,
      "end": 197.68,
      "duration": 3.18,
      "learnable": true,
      "audio": "audio/voa-pets-b1-011.m4a"
    },
    {
      "id": "voa-pets-b1-012",
      "text": "It's a big responsibility.",
      "translation": "这是一项重大的责任。",
      "start": 204.9,
      "end": 206.38,
      "duration": 1.48,
      "learnable": true,
      "audio": "audio/voa-pets-b1-012.m4a"
    },
    {
      "id": "voa-pets-b1-013",
      "text": "You may want to spend time with a dog first.",
      "translation": "你可能想先花些时间和狗相处。",
      "start": 206.88,
      "end": 209.98,
      "duration": 3.1,
      "learnable": true,
      "audio": "audio/voa-pets-b1-013.m4a"
    },
    {
      "id": "voa-pets-b1-014",
      "text": "Do you want to watch Dublin for a couple of hours?",
      "translation": "你想照看都柏林几个小时吗？",
      "start": 219.96,
      "end": 223.18,
      "duration": 3.22,
      "learnable": true,
      "audio": "audio/voa-pets-b1-014.m4a"
    },
    {
      "id": "voa-pets-b1-015",
      "text": "I will take very good care of him.",
      "translation": "我会非常好地照顾它。",
      "start": 224.02,
      "end": 227.0,
      "duration": 2.98,
      "learnable": true,
      "audio": "audio/voa-pets-b1-015.m4a"
    },
    {
      "id": "voa-pets-b1-016",
      "text": "I don't want you to be lonely.",
      "translation": "我不想让你感到孤单。",
      "start": 233.7,
      "end": 236.1,
      "duration": 2.4,
      "learnable": true,
      "audio": "audio/voa-pets-b1-016.m4a"
    }
  ]
}
